          }
        ],
        "bgm": "great_mission_heroic.mp3",
        "ratio": 1,
        "width": 17,
        "height": 13
      },
      "events": [
        {
          "kind": "layout.set",
          "value": {
            "avg": true,
            "position": "down",
            "offset": 0,
            "align": "left",
            "bold": true,
            "background": "winskin.png",
            "title": [
              255,
              225,
              80,
              1
            ],
            "text": [
              255,
              255,
              255,
              1
            ],
            "titlefont": 22,
            "textfont": 16,
            "lineHeight": 22,
            "time": 10,
            "letterSpacing": 0,
            "animateTime": 120
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "士郎的打鐵聲源源不絕，只需要經過附近梗平已經能準確定位到士郎來打鐵的秘密(?)基地"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平興高采烈地湊上前"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "唷！還在練習打鐵嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "打鐵不單止需要一時的學習，更要持續不斷的鍛鍊。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "僅僅是這樣水平的話，還遠遠不夠去奪冠。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "在下也忘了沒問你，這比賽除了要組隊參賽外還有其他規限嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "刀形、材料那些有沒有限制？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "沒有的兄弟沒有的，賽制聽說到時候現場會公佈，不過用具也要自己攜帶。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "用來煮飯切菜的廚刀，刀形果然還是中式菜刀吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "No, Niet, Nein!!!既然如此，這個就是你的誤區了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "鍛刀是自由的！即使是廚刀也只是一個名稱，只要刀夠好那他就什麼都能做到口牙！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "就讓我們鍛造出世界上第一把規格外的廚刀。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "何ヰ味？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "廚刀只要能把東西切開就好，像你這樣打鐵的要想的就多了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "還有拍蒜那些的用法啦。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "這樣把刀背加厚，給我發揮你的想像力呀kora!",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "廚刀的重點不是廚不廚，交上去的是刀就夠了。相信我就對了!",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "是這樣的嗎？這不對吧!",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "料理也是需要創新的，等我一下。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平隨後快速翻找手機的相簿"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "士郎！快看這張！能打出來嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "shirou_blades.png",
          "sloc": [0, 0, 416, 286],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "構造雖然很誇張...重心偏前但如果修改刀脊弧度並重組力學結構的話...好像可行。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "都說是可行的了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "按你所說，只要不妨礙切肉的效率，就算外型再誇張也無妨。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "畢竟最終要測試用刀的是我們。所以，我們能夠熟練使用類似的刀型就可以了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "啊！？汝不早言！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "阿對了，我剛剛收到了其他隊伍的名單，你要看看嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "反正也看不懂，不過聽一聽一定總比沒有好。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "總括而言現在參賽隊伍包括我們，有三隊。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "另外兩隻的隊名是「唐家三少」以及「蜘蛛巢相親相愛一家親」。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "那是名門望族小組以及家庭參賽小組嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "不知道，網上也找不到太多資訊。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "不過有傳言說，他們是從其他國家遠道而來為了爭奪隕鐵的人。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "謝啦，給了我那麼多的靈感。比賽的時候再見吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "akiba.event.complete",
          "eventId": "shirou_2"
        },
        {
          "kind": "function.call",
          "function": "function () { core.plugin.addAkibaEvent({ id: 'shirou_3', title: '鍛刀大賽', locations: ['chinese_restaurant'], floorId: 'shirou_3', once: true }); }"
        },
        {
          "kind": "akiba.return"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
