            ],
            "titlefont": 22,
            "textfont": 16,
            "lineHeight": 22,
            "time": 10,
            "letterSpacing": 0,
            "animateTime": 120
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平如約準時在比賽開始前到了比賽場地"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "而他找到了正在中華料理店前在準備工具的士郎"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "Aibo 你準備好了嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "上啊士郎，給這群傳統鐵匠一點二次元震撼！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "background.show",
          "role": "image",
          "code": 1,
          "image": "ms_bg_tournament_venue.png",
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "走了一會他們到了比賽場地，梗平看了一眼四周"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "空地之上，坐在評判席上的是中華料理店的老闆以及收購所的老闆"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "然後映入眼簾是分隔了三個區域的區間"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "中間那個間隔就是我們的了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "時間到了選手請各自就位，我很期待各位的作品。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "(他是在看在下嗎？)",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "旁邊這位會作為本次比賽的安檢員，東方不敗。確保不會有人比賽而受傷。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "(這個人的氣勢太可怕了)",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "（東方不敗後點了點頭)"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "接下來就交給我吧，我會證明二次元的力量給他們看！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "士郎，不要輸呀！我也開始燃起來了！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "那麼接下來我會公佈本次賽程，比賽分為兩部分。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "第一部分會要求每組大致斷打出刀型交給我審核。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "雖說如此，這次比賽不會限制各位選手對刀型的自由度追求，其後淘汰一位進度最差的。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "畢竟在料理界，時間可是金錢，達不到標準的人沒有存在的價值。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "第二回合將會要求各位完善，以及打磨到完整的整把廚刀。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "然後每組派出一位代表，展示刀的鋒利程度以及對刀的使用。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "這時候，左邊傳來幾位少爺的嘲笑聲"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "唐三",
          "text": "都什麼時代了，我們煉器直接用我們魂環科技的設備就好了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_tangsan.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "唐三",
          "text": "用火爐的原始人，哈哈哈！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_tangsan.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "唐三",
          "text": "隕鐵鋼材將會是我們的了！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_tangsan.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "少爺小組居然拿著高科技設備嘲笑我們的老風箱！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "士郎，給他們看看我們這幾天磨練出來的真正厲害！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "鍛造的本質不在於機器有多先進，而在於對鋼材與料理心意。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "看我們直接在第一階段把他淘汰出去。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "東方不敗",
          "text": "3!2!1! Game Start!!!",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_shisho.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "時間一分一秒的過去"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "和設想的不同，左邊傳來的不是打鐵聲，右邊傳來的更只有吵架的聲音"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "看起來有在認真打鐵的只有我們這組了，這裏還是鍛刀大賽嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "只要好好打鐵就能贏了！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "突然左邊傳來慘叫，連帶著爆炸聲以及燒焦的味道"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "東方不敗閃身而過眨眼功夫便從評判席衝了向左邊的間隔"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "唐家三少小組因為用具故障直接被抬離場了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "只是技術性調整，沒有人會在這次比賽中受到傷害。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "另外兩組可以直接進入第二階段。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "與此同時右邊間隔的咒罵聲越發起勁"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平只能大概聽到什麼券、什麼藝術、什麼家人呀犧牲呀"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "還有什麼指令呀之類的不明所以的東西"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "相親相愛？看來只有內訌自爆的部分吧！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "呼，進度良好。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "局勢大好呀，現在已經完全沒有落敗的可能了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "時間已經到比賽最後的五分鐘"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "現在只差刀刃淬火的一步，只要成功就完成了！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "shirou_blades.png",
          "sloc": [0, 0, 416, 286],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "過來讓我看看，完成度也太高了吧！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "最後一步就由在下來吧",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "畢竟在下什麼也沒有幫上忙，而且水淬之力我也不是沒有聽過",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "小心點，他還沒降溫，最後一步就交給你了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平輕輕的把刀刃慢慢從尖端浸入水中，雙刀慢慢冷卻硬化"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "水焠沒有花太多時間，士郎一眼便看出ㄧㄧ刀歪了"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "是由於兩邊不均勻的冷卻導致的，都是運氣的問題"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "完成的時候時間也剛好結束了"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "怎麼辦好？這個可比不上那把刀！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "現在的時間也不夠再打一對刀出來呀！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "只能動用殺手鐧了嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "接下來我將以紅色形態出擊！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "啊？！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "給我五...不，三分鐘！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "那麼請第一組的代表出來吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "蜘蛛巢相親相愛一家親的代表滿身傷痕，拿著一把日本武士郎刀出列"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "良秀",
          "text": "在下良秀",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_liangxiu.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "請蜘蛛巢相親相愛一家親小組的代表盡可能切開面前的豬肉，限時五分鐘。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "tournament_katana.png",
          "sloc": [0, 0, 416, 286],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "良秀拔出了那把腰間的刀，透明的刀刃折射著背後的景色"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "一刀，豬肉一分為二，如同切牛油般被斬開"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "又一刀，在豬肉下落之前又分成再兩份"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "三分鐘內無數的斬擊穿過豬肉，梗平不可置信的看着"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "贏不了，真的贏不了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "Trace On!",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "shirou_e01_cg.jpeg",
          "sloc": [0, 0, 416, 286],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "背後傳來一聲"
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "梗平轉過頭去，發現士郎的左臂發出淡淡藍光"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"I am the bone of my sword.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"Steel is my body, and fire is my blood.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"I have created over a thousand blades.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"Unknown to Death, nor known to Life.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"Have withstood pain to create many weapons.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"Yet, those hands will never hold anything.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "你在做什麼？是魔法嗎？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.show",
          "role": "cg",
          "code": 30,
          "image": "shirou_e02_cg.jpeg",
          "sloc": [0, 0, 416, 286],
          "loc": [
            112,
            50,
            320,
            220
          ],
          "opacity": 1,
          "time": 0
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "\"So as I pray, Unlimited Blade Works.\"",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "隨後兩把比完美更完美的干將·莫邪從地上投影出來"
        },
        {
          "kind": "image.hide",
          "code": 30,
          "time": 0,
          "async": true
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "為什麼不一開始就用紅色形態呀！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "如果你能投影的話, 為什麼一開始還要打鐵呀！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "士郎",
          "text": "不打鐵，是不能體會到這種辛酸的。接下來就靠你了...",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "shirou_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "士郎，倒下"
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "士郎！郎！明明有這麼方便的東西，你不一早拿出來用做什麼呀！？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "那麼第二組的代表出來吧。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "是要時候開始表演了嗎？我的瘋狗刀法！",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "不，只要你們能展現出這把刀能一刀切開豬肉就贏了。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "梗平",
          "text": "？",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 10,
            "image": "keng_neutral_portrait.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "dialogue",
          "speaker": "麻婆",
          "text": "良秀的刀所斬過的食材，似乎無法正常的食用以及烹飪，並不能勝任作為廚刀。",
          "portrait": {
            "code": 20,
            "image": "ms_portrait_mapo_normal.png"
          }
        },
        {
